# Files excluded from the coverage total, as llvm-cov `-ignore-filename-regex`
# patterns (one per line, `#` starts a comment). Rationale for each entry lives
# in hai/CONTEXT.md § Test. Adding a file here is a deliberate act: every entry
# must fall into one of the exclusion categories allowed by AGENTS.md.

# Test sources themselves — counting them would inflate the total.
Tests/

# SwiftPM's generated XCTest entry point (auto-generated code).
\.derived/runner\.swift

# Sources/Island is the executable target: NSApplication bootstrap and pure
# AppKit / Carbon wiring. Every decision it makes is delegated to IslandCore,
# which is covered. Keep this list in sync if a new file lands there.
Sources/Island/main\.swift
Sources/Island/AppDelegate\.swift
Sources/Island/OverlayPanel\.swift
Sources/Island/OverlayContent\.swift
Sources/Island/HotkeyRegistrar\.swift
Sources/Island/ResolvedConfiguration\.swift
